  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "The glyphs, where the shafts and motes rise and the circle's starting angle change per cast. The loop itself never changes length: halo rings every 1.5 s, two rings in flight."
  },
  "director_notes": "Lisa asked for chivalry/paladin auras. Built as a calm protective field: everything slow and even so it can sit under a character for minutes. The 8-fold glyph circle turns 45 degrees per 3 s loop and the 4-fold seal 90 degrees the other way, so both line up again at the loop's end. One-shot consecration ring only in the start-up. In an engine, loop 1200-4200 ms."
